  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57a8e05a8a1d4451e9081ab70ab1f576, type: 3}
  itemDescription: 'Mining and Hydrocarbons Technologies Institute  This institute
    focuses on technologies for the mining sector and hydrocarbon (oil & gas) industries.
    Its mission includes enhancing mineral exploration and extraction methods, improving
    mining safety and environmental practices, and optimizing hydrocarbon recovery.
    Key research areas: geophysical exploration techniques (e.g. seismic imaging
    improvements), mineral processing and beneficiation, advanced drilling technologies,
    and enhanced oil recovery methods. The institute aims to make mining more efficient
    and sustainable, and to extend the productive life of oil & gas fields by applying
    cutting-edge science and engineering. It also explores new uses for hydrocarbons
    (like petrochemical feedstocks) to add value to extracted resources'
  description: 
